    "details": "<p><strong>Expanding Horizon 8.0 &ndash; Mechanical Engineering</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Organized by: Student Mentorship Program (SMP), MNNIT Allahabad</strong></p>\n<p>Expanding Horizon 8.0 &ndash; Mechanical Engineering is an initiative by the Student Mentorship Program (SMP), MNNIT Allahabad, designed to help aspiring mechanical engineers evaluate their technical understanding and prepare for the upcoming internship season.</p>\n<p>The assessment focuses on core Mechanical Engineering concepts, testing participants' conceptual clarity, technical aptitude, and ability to apply engineering principles to solve problems.</p>\n<p><strong>Objectives</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Evaluate fundamentals of Engineering Mechanics.</li>\n<li>Assess understanding of Thermodynamics and Heat Transfer.</li>\n<li>Test knowledge of Fluid Mechanics.</li>\n<li>Strengthen concepts in Manufacturing Processes.</li>\n<li>Evaluate understanding of Theory of Machines and Machine Design.</li>\n<li>Encourage analytical thinking and application-based problem-solving.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Guidelines</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The assessment will be conducted online through Unstop.</li>\n<li>Participants must attempt all questions within the stipulated time.</li>\n<li>Submissions will be evaluated according to predefined criteria.</li>\n<li>Any unfair means or plagiarism is strictly prohibited.</li>\n<li>The decision of the organizing team will be final.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Think. Design. Engineer. Excel!</strong></p>",
